+- **D1:** idea
+- **D2:** structured concept
+- **D3:** implementation-ready design
+- **I0:** no verified implementation
+- **I1:** isolated prototype
+- **I2:** integrated prototype
+- **I3:** benchmarked representative implementation
+- **I4:** production-ready
