+
+# Promotion Order
+
+```text
+identity and common core
+→ one hull and three profiles
+→ nested mobile home
+→ station and delegation
+→ ownership and command
+→ damage and succession
+→ construction proof
+→ hull variety
+→ benchmark and performance
+```
+
+# Current Decision
+
+All v2.9 capabilities remain **D3 / I0**, except performance budgeting which remains **D2 / I0** until engine profiling supplies credible targets.
+
+No claim may state that Symtropy supports player-built civilization carriers until a representative construction, docking, ownership and operations implementation passes the benchmark.
+
+## Readiness Maxim
+
+> **A carrier is not ready when its model is large. It is ready when its many roles, people, vehicles and failures remain coherent under one authoritative truth.**
